QUERY NAME: QryFinYr
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT DISTINCTROW TblFinYrs.[Financial Year], tblProject.StartDate, TblFinYrs.StartDate, TblFinYrs.EndDate, tblProject.Project
FROM TblFinYrs, tblProject
WHERE ((TblFinYrs.StartDate<[tblProject]![StartDate]) AND (TblFinYrs.EndDate>[tblProject]![StartDate]));

